## Overview

`common-lib` is a Helm library chart providing reusable helper templates for application charts.

## Prerequisites

- Helm ≥ 3.12

## Installation

Library charts cannot be installed directly. Declare as a dependency:

```yaml
dependencies:
  - name: common-lib
    version: ">=0.1.0 <1.0.0"
    repository: "file://../common-lib"
```

## Configuration

This chart has no user-facing configuration. Helpers consume values from the application chart.

## Helper Reference

| Helper | Output | Guard |
|--------|--------|-------|
| `common-lib.fullname` | Resource name (63-char) | — |
| `common-lib.chart` | Chart name-version | — |
| `common-lib.labels` | 6 base labels + extras | — |
| `common-lib.selectorLabels` | 2 selector labels | — |
| `common-lib.annotations` | 2 base annotations + extras | — |
| `common-lib.deployment` | Deployment YAML | `workloadType == deployment` |
| `common-lib.service` | Service YAML | `workloadType == deployment` |
| `common-lib.ingress` | Ingress YAML | `ingress.enabled` |
| `common-lib.hpa` | HPA YAML | `autoscaling.enabled` |
| `common-lib.configmap` | ConfigMap YAML | data non-empty |
| `common-lib.secrets` | Secret YAML | data non-empty |
| `common-lib.serviceaccount` | ServiceAccount YAML | `serviceAccount.create` |
| `common-lib.podsecurity` | Security context fragment | — |

## Examples

See the [web-app](../web-app/) chart for a complete integration example.

## Upgrade Notes

### 0.2.0

Added Ingress, HPA, ConfigMap, and Secret helpers.

### 0.1.0

Initial release.

## Troubleshooting

| Problem | Solution |
|---------|----------|
| Helper not found | Run `helm dependency build` on consuming chart |
| Missing labels | Use dict pattern: `(dict "root" .)` |
